 "title": "$\\alpha_f$ is an isomorphism for every $f$",
 "statement": "Let $\\Lambda$ be a condensed ring and let $f\\colon X\\to Y$ be any morphism of\nschemes. Then $\\alpha_f\\colon f^*\\Lambda_Y\\to\\Lambda_X$ ([def-sfb-alpha]) is\nan isomorphism.",
 "source": {
