 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By definition, $\\alpha_f$ is the component at $\\Lambda$ of the natural\nisomorphism $f^*\\circ p_Y^*\\cong p_X^*$ of\n[def-sfb-pullback-from-point-comp-iso]. Components of natural isomorphisms\nare isomorphisms.",
